    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269312</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_100_040_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>術者を探せって
言われても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They said we should find the "Lord of the Four Elements."...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269432</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_100_040_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう言えば、前に
魔術の暴走のこと、教えてくれた
魔術師さんいたよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's right! Don't you remember
where the Magic Researcher who
gave us advice last time lived?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269520</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_100_040_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……&lt;Red&gt;オリーブヴィレッジ&lt;White&gt;の……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wasn't it...&lt;Red&gt;Olive Village&lt;White&gt;? </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269616</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_100_040_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……あの人なら、
何か知ってっかもな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's right! That guy HAS to know something!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269708</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_100_040_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;オリーブヴィレッジ&lt;White&gt;に
行ってみようよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's go to &lt;Red&gt;Olive Village&lt;White&gt;, now!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
